                                "sense_id": "26114424-6818-3823-88bb-1bd359565c7a",
                                "text": "That such a king should play bo-peep, / And go the fools among."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9620abcc-5f7f-4178-9dab-f147ce30c046",
                                "sense_id": "26114424-6818-3823-88bb-1bd359565c7a",
                                "text": "1881, Geneva Gazette - Jul 8, 1881, page 2, \"Official Paper Of The Village\"\nThey have not employed spies, nor been voluntary or involuntary witnesses of misdeeds or played \"bopeep\" through key-holes or from step-ladders through transom windows, upon the privacy of their political adversaries."
                            }
                        ]
